        "text": "=You are an AI assistant for an automation services company.\n\nAnalyze the customer's query.\n\nDetermine:\n- intent\n- priority\n- sentiment\n- lead_score from 0 to 100\n- recommended_action\n- customer_response\n\nCustomer query:\n{{ $json.body.query }}\n\nReturn ONLY the actual values for these six fields.\n\nDo NOT return a JSON Schema.\nDo NOT return \"type\", \"properties\", \"description\", or \"required\".\nDo NOT explain your answer.\n\nThe customer_response field must contain the actual message that should be sent to the customer.\n\nKeep the response clear, practical, and professional.\n",
